  "jcr:description": "Ignite injectable stimulus combines an injectable cellular scaffold, demineralized bone matrix (DBM), and aspirated bone marrow. The combination provides a minimally invasive graft with osteoconductive, osteoinductive, and osteogenic capacity.",
